flowchart TD
  A([Start the program]) --> B[Log In]
  B -->|valid name + password| D[Main Menu]
  B -->|no account yet| C[Sign Up]
  C -->|account created| B
  D --> E[Choose Location<br/>Egypt / Mexico / Cambodia]
  D --> K[Trading Post<br/>sell relics, buy skins]
  D --> L[How to Play]
  D --> M[Hall of Fame]
  D --> N([Quit])
  E --> F[Prepare Expedition<br/>difficulty + size 10-50]
  F -->|size is valid| G[Generate a new pyramid]
  G --> H[Playing]
  H <-->|P / Esc| I[Pause menu]
  H -->|exit reached /<br/>no lives / time up| J[Results]
  J -->|Play Again| G
  J -->|Main Menu| D
